# Sang's self-contained preview: every page, stylesheet and image inlined into one HTML file
# (1.3MB in v11, built by his tools/build_preview.py). It is media in an .html wrapper, and the
# pages it is built from are committed beside it. See README.md.
package-*/OPEN-ME.html
package-*/START-HERE.html

# v18 (2026-09-15): `instatic-css/` is a byte-for-byte duplicate of `assets/pages/` (Sang: "a duplicate flat copy
# of all page CSS files for easy upload/copy-paste"); the pipeline reads assets/pages/, so the copy stays out.
package-*/instatic-css/
